    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just heavy. it's like... why bother trying to be \"present\" at all? if everything is just light on a screen and static in a room, what's the point of fighting to stay connected to it? it feels like i'm just pretending to be a person. it would be so much easier if i could just stop performing the act of existing.",
